# gen_fixtures.py rebuilds these deterministically from the definitions in that file, which
# is the single source of truth for what each fixture is meant to test. Committing the
# generated JSON alongside it lets the two drift apart silently — a reviewer reading the
# generator would not see that the checked-in copy no longer matches it.
#
# lang/zh.json is NOT generated and is committed: it is a runtime dependency, and without it
# analyze.py has no Chinese output at all.
fixtures/
